<title>USA: NYSE closing averages. [CORRECTED 00:35 GMT 26/2]</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages. [CORRECTED 00:35 GMT 26/2]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 30.01 to 7038.21.</p>
<p>(Corrects rise in Dow Jones Industrial Average)</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.04 to 425.52.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.10.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1415 to 1135.</p>
<p>Volume was 527,430,190 compared with 459,910,840 on Monday.</p>
